5,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"Good evening, everyone. I hope we can find peace in this strange situation.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shizue,,"Good evening, Jonathan. I am Shizue. Let us all stay calm and kind to one another.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Asuka,,"I am Asuka. Let us focus on logic, not sentiment. We need to identify the threat efficiently.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Kenji,,"Hi everyone! I’m Kenji. I’m a bit nervous, but I’m ready to help. Let’s figure this out together!","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Shion,,"I am Shion. Let’s observe. Asuka’s logic is noted. Kenji, your nervousness is a liability.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,I appreciate the introductions. Let us listen carefully to each other’s words before making any judgments.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shizue,,"I agree with Jonathan. Let us listen with open hearts. Kenji, please do not worry; we are all in this together.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Asuka,,"Shion, your immediate judgment is inefficient. We lack data. Kenji, your anxiety is irrelevant to the logic. Focus on facts, not feelings.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"I’m sorry, Shion, I didn’t mean to worry you! I’m just excited to help. Asuka, I’ll focus on facts.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Asuka, your rigidity is amusing. Kenji, your apology is unnecessary. We have no data yet. Let us wait for the night to reveal its secrets.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Asuka"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,I agree with Shion. We must wait for the night to pass. Patience is key to finding the truth.,"{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shizue,,I agree with Jonathan. Patience is a virtue. Let us rest peacefully and trust that the truth will emerge gently.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Asuka,,Agreed. Patience is logical. We have no information to act on. Let us wait for the night to provide data.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Kenji,,Agreed! I’ll stay calm and watchful. Let’s hope the night brings us some clues to work with.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Shion,,Agreed. Silence is data. Let the night speak.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,"A quiet night brings clarity. I will rest now, hoping for a peaceful dawn.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shizue,,"A peaceful night brings wisdom. I will rest gently, trusting in the kindness of our community. Goodnight, dear friends.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Asuka,,Rest is inefficient. I will observe. Goodnight.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
