41,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I remain quiet. Shion’s calm is intriguing, but Kenji’s certainty is loud. Asuka, what is your logical assessment of their conflicting claims?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Shion"",""Kenji"",""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
